ith no adjacent tiles in hand to form sequences, and discarding it does not hurt any major point patterns. Keeping all honors increases chances for All Types (6 points) and potential wind/dragon pungs if drawn later. The hand already has pairs, so focus is on building melds from honors or remaining suited tiles.\n\n**Answer:** Play W5"}
